<main>
  <article class="sheet letter">
    <h1>Prep King</h1>
    <p>Prep King is the week before you preach. You send a text or a topic. You get sixty minutes of prep you can hear and read, on a private link. Prep King is $20 a month for four Sundays.</p>
    <p>Use that month’s packs for your own preaching. We keep the audio and the coverage. We do not keep the sermon you write.</p>

    <div class="player">
      <p class="player-kicker">Prep brief</p>
      <div class="player-row">
        <button type="button" class="play" disabled aria-label="Play is unavailable. No brief is loaded.">
          <span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="player-meta">
          <p class="player-title">Prep brief</p>
          <p class="player-sub">Listenable brief for the pastor</p>
          <div class="scrub" role="progressbar" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" aria-valuetext="No audio loaded" aria-label="Prep brief progress">
            <span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="times"><span>0:00</span><span>0:00</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="transcript">
        <h2>Transcript</h2>
        <p>The transcript sits here with the audio.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="player-note">No demo brief is loaded yet.</p>
    </div>

    <p>Write <a href="mailto:chris@sovgracekc.org?subject=Prep%20King">Chris Oswald</a> if you want in.</p>
  </article>
